  "details": "When I request a missing avatar over OSC, VRChat immediately sends the requested ID back in an outgoing /avatar/change message. The client logs that the avatar is inaccessible, and I stay in the avatar I was already wearing.\n\nHow to reproduce\n\n* Send a non-existing, but valid avatar uuid to /avatar/change\n\n* On listening OSC the requested ID comes back even though the avatar stays the same\n\nI also checked OSCQuery. /avatar/change showed the missing ID, while /avatar/name still showed the avatar I was wearing.\n\nWhen a switch succeeded, I received two messages with the same ID, one immediately and one when the avatar loaded.",
